Summary
This article explains how to configure Vision Sync for Exchange to use a single or specific EWS server instead of Autodiscover.
Discussion
In on-prem Exchange environments with multiple servers, Vision Sync for Exchange can automatically locate EWS through Autodiscover. However, you can configure the application to use a single or specific EWS server when connecting to mailboxes.
 
Note: These instructions apply to on-prem Exchange environments where there may be multiple Exchange servers.
 
